  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expanding civic space through strengthening youth and feminist voices</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Asia regional influencing strategy signed off in 2022 identified gender justice and climate justice as two major influencing themes to pursue with cross cutting engagement to expand civic space. Given the diversity and uniqueness in the region which is also economically growing but with huge cost of gender and economic inequality. Government and other actors rather addressing the challenges of poverty and inequality are engaged in silencing the dissent, putting new regulations and laws to reduce civic space, peaceful assembly, and freedom of press.   Oxfam in Asia platform has existing initiatives to strengthen feminist movements and youth activism. The initiatives include facilitating feminist coalition, Oxfam youth leaders fellowship programme and digital activists/Asia lab toolkit. Building on these experience and existing initiatives we would like to expand and continue these pieces of work.</narrative>
  </description>
